    "body": "     Console page / control  Device call  Equivalent SDK function  Expected result      Add reader → Ethernet → Search devices  mDNS / DNS-SD on the local LAN  ReaderDiscovery.SearchAsync  Board IDs and advertised endpoints. Select a row to connect and verify identity.    Add reader → Connect reader  hello  ConnectAsync  Connect and verify reader identity and capabilities.    Connection → Refresh status  status.get  GetStatusAsync  Reader and boot identity, RF state, input errors    Connection → Ethernet configuration  network.get / network.set  GetNetworkAsync / SaveNetworkAsync  Effective IPv4, address source, saved profile and  restart_required     RF settings → Apply to all  reader.set_config  SetPowerAsync  Volatile power write and readback    RF settings → Antenna power  get_power / set_power  GetPowerAsync / SetPowerConfigurationAsync  ANT1–ANT4 values, persistence selection    RF settings → Baseband  get_baseband / set_baseband  GetBasebandAsync / SetBasebandAsync  speed, q_value, session, inventory_flag    RF settings → RF band / F-hop  get_rf_band / set_rf_band; get_working_frequency / set_working_frequency  GetRfBandAsync / SetRfBandAsync; GetWorkingFrequencyAsync / SetWorkingFrequencyAsync  Band and ordered channel list    RF settings → Tag upload filter  get_filter_settings / set_filter_settings  GetFilterSettingsAsync / SetFilterSettingsAsync  Repeat interval and raw RSSI threshold.    Read tags → Start reading / Stop  inventory.start / inventory.stop  StartInventoryAsync / StopInventoryAsync  Session of each reader and final data completeness    Tag access → Write EPC  write_epc  WriteEpcAsync  ACK, computed PC, then scan verification    Diagnostics → Acquire / Release control  lease.acquire / lease.release  AcquireLeaseAsync / ReleaseLeaseAsync  Lease state. Reader Management Console renews the lease every second while it holds it.    Diagnostics → Get retained result  module.result  GetModuleResultAsync  Result of the earlier write, looked up by its UUID    Maintenance → Upload and verify  ota.begin / ota.chunk / ota.finish  StageFirmwareAsync  Verified image staged for next boot    Maintenance → Restart reader  system.reboot  RebootAsync  Reconnect and compare running image digest    Diagnostics → Cached antenna power  reader.get_config  GetReaderConfigurationAsync  Power cache and firmware ceiling.    Diagnostics → Reader identity / Serial number  get_reader_info / get_serial_number  GetReaderInfoAsync / GetSerialNumberAsync  Serial number of the RFID module and time since the module was powered.    Maintenance → Read firmware status / Cancel upload  ota.status / ota.abort  GetFirmwareStatusAsync / cancel the token passed to StageFirmwareAsync  Running or staged image identity and transfer status.     \n In the second column, names with a dot are Reader Control API methods. Names without a dot, such as get_power, are RFID module operations sent through the method  module.call . \n Use  Firmware APIs  to inspect the API catalog advertised by the selected reader and navigate to its control. Module controls are filtered by  hello.module_operations . \n Every control in Reader Management Console uses the same SDK functions an application can call. Use the app to find working values, then call the function in the third column from your code. \n   ReaderClient function reference    Reader Control API method index   "
